triage: fix_game: Every failing scenario breaks at the bidding poll. No seat was ever offered the options 0 or 2 that the tests look for, and all bids came out as 0, even though the rules say a missing bid counts as 1. The rules and the tests are consistent; the game file builds the bid poll wrongly.
